# nexora-action-code: get_memory
Value Filldown FREE_PAGES (\d+)
Value Filldown MIN_WATERMARK (\d+)
Value Filldown LOWER_WATERMARK (\d+)
Value Filldown LOW_WATERMARK (\d+)
Value Filldown HIGH_WATERMARK (\d+)
Value Filldown TOTAL_MEMORY_MB (\d+)
Value Filldown CURRENT_FREE_MEMORY_KB (\d+)
Value Required USED_RATE (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^\s*Free pages:\s*${FREE_PAGES}\s*$$
  ^\s*watermarks\s*:\s*min\s+${MIN_WATERMARK},\s*lower\s+${LOWER_WATERMARK},\s*low\s+${LOW_WATERMARK},\s*high\s+${HIGH_WATERMARK}\s*$$
  ^\s*System Total Memory\s*:\s*${TOTAL_MEMORY_MB}MB,\s*Current Free Memory\s*:\s*${CURRENT_FREE_MEMORY_KB}KB\s*$$
  ^\s*Used Rate\s*:\s*${USED_RATE}%\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Next
